{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DISCLAIMER: Currently in the process of turning Take the Earth fully 3D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take the Earth</strong> is an action conquest open-world game set in the 13th Century. Begin as a captive, fight and conquer other empires until you become world emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A diverse <strong>explorable world</strong> with hidden secrets and mythological legends to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A<strong> day and night</strong> cycle which you can use to your benefit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong> with customizable gameplay and armies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique top-down movement system that allows for more<strong> in-depth combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse factions</strong> with different combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reactive enemies</strong> that are also trying to conquer the world</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2481660?t=1745150237","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2481660?t=1745150237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745150237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745150237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DISCLAIMER: Currently in the process of turning Take the Earth fully 3D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take the Earth</str